WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.958
<b><font color='#000000'>If you want to submit your data for archiving you need to be in the "Archive" tab. </font></b>

2
00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:09.083
<b><font color='#000000'>Here you can find your current data packages that have not yet been archived</font></b>

3
00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:11.083
<b><font color='#000000'> under the status "Active". </font></b>

4
00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:15.125
<b><font color='#000000'>If your package is in this status, you can edit it at any time</font></b>

5
00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:18.083
<b><font color='#000000'>by switching back to the "Editor" tab above. </font></b>

6
00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:23.666
<b><font color='#000000'>To finalize your data for the submit, you need to add some organizational information.</font></b>

7
00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:28.083
<b><font color='#000000'>Therefore, use the settings symbol right next to the book symbol.</font></b>

8
00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:32.750
<b><font color='#000000'>Under "Legal", you have to agree to the necessary terms and conditions. </font></b>

9
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.916
<b><font color='#000000'>This includes that you have signed a data transfer agreement with your institution</font></b>

10
00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:41.958
<b><font color='#000000'>prior to archiving and that any personal data in the package has been processed</font></b>

11
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.250
<b><font color='#000000'>in accordance with the relevant guidelines.</font></b>

12
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.833
<b><font color='#000000'>Once you have entered all of the necessary information, save your changes. </font></b>

13
00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:52.458
<b><font color='#000000'>When your data package is ready to be reviewed by a data curator, </font></b>

14
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:55.916
<b><font color='#000000'>use the "Submit package" button at the top right.</font></b>

15
00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:59.541
<b><font color='#000000'>As you can see, the status of your package has now changed </font></b>

16
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:02.125
<b><font color='#000000'>and you can find it under "In Review".</font></b>

17
00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:05.958
<b><font color='#000000'>This means that your package is currently being reviewed by a curator. </font></b>

18
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:10.083
<b><font color='#000000'>While your package is in this status, you won´t be able to edit it. </font></b>

19
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:14.583
<b><font color='#000000'>The curator will return your data package for revision if there is a need to clarify</font></b>

20
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:17.833
<b><font color='#000000'>or if, for example, important metadata is missing.</font></b>

